WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 11.1 · Fundraising, Revenue & Sustainable Business Models
Resource model, fundraising strategy and financial management

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Separate who pays and why from how you will raise money this year.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Name who pays, for what value, and why.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Plan this year’s income separately from your underlying model.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Count only income confirmed in writing.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Riverside Repair Hub (Hybrid · charity with a trading company, United Kingdom)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Riverside: grants, the council and donors fund free repair; shop profit adds £25,000. Gap: £60,000 when a grant ends in 2027.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your resource model and your funding gap.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
